{"id":39436,"date":"2025-01-03T00:13:13","date_gmt":"2025-01-02T23:13:13","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/trail-winter-challenge-s-a-vila-gale-2025\/"},"modified":"2026-10-27T15:43:21","modified_gmt":"2026-10-27T14:43:21","slug":"trail-winter-challenge-s-a-vila-gale","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/trail-winter-challenge-s-a-vila-gale\/","title":{"rendered":"Trail Winter Challenge S.A. \u2013 Vila Gal\u00e9 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Trail Winter Challenge S.A. \u2013 Vila Gal\u00e9 2026<\/span><\/h2><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">Trail Winter Challenge S.A. \u2013 Vila Gal\u00e9 2026<\/strong> (3\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o) realiza-se na manh\u00e3 de domingo, <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">13 de dezembro de 2026<\/strong>, com centro operacional, partida e chegada instalados junto \u00e0 <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">Praia da Baleia \/ Hotel Vila Gal\u00e9 Ericeira<\/strong>, na vila da <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">Ericeira<\/strong> (concelho de <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">Mafra<\/strong>, distrito de Lisboa). Constituindo a 3\u00aa e \u00faltima etapa do <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">Circuito Challenge S.A. 2026<\/strong>, o evento \u00e9 limitado a <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">500 participantes<\/strong> e integra o <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">Trail Longo de 20 km<\/strong> (partida \u00e0s <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">09:30<\/strong>), o <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">Trail Curto de 12 km<\/strong> (partida \u00e0s <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">09:40<\/strong>) e a <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">Caminhada de 10 km<\/strong> com iniciativa *Plogging* (partida \u00e0s <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">09:45<\/strong>).<\/p><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Ao correres nos trilhos costeiros e vales interiores da <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">Ericeira<\/strong>, Reserva Mundial de Surf no concelho de <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">Mafra<\/strong>, desfrutas de vistas panor\u00e2micas sobre o Atl\u00e2ntico combinadas com caminhos rurais e fal\u00e9sias. O evento distingue-se pela sua voca\u00e7\u00e3o ecol\u00f3gica, inclusiva (em parceria com os projetos *Sexto Sentido* e *Inclus\u00e3o Sem Barreiras* para atletas invisuais e guias) e *animal friendly*, sendo obrigat\u00f3rio o transporte de recipiente pr\u00f3prio para hidrata\u00e7\u00e3o, telem\u00f3vel operacional e documento de identifica\u00e7\u00e3o.<\/p><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">Organizada por <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">S\u00f3nia Andrade (S.A.)<\/strong> com o patroc\u00ednio *naming* dos <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">Hot\u00e9is Vila Gal\u00e9<\/strong>, a prova oferece a todos os participantes <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">1 vale de estadia Vila Gal\u00e9 de 20,00 \u20ac<\/strong>, <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">medalha *finisher* em formato puzzle<\/strong> (que completa a cole\u00e7\u00e3o das tr\u00eas provas do circuito), abastecimentos e conv\u00edvio final com bolinhos, ch\u00e1 e caf\u00e9, al\u00e9m de premiar os vencedores M\/F de cada escal\u00e3o (Seniores a Veteranos 65) no Trail Longo e Trail Curto com <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">1 estadia dupla nos Hot\u00e9is Vila Gal\u00e9<\/strong> (Portugal, Brasil e Espanha). Consulta o calend\u00e1rio nacional de provas de <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/trail\/\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; text-decoration: underline;\">Trail Running em Portugal<\/a>.<\/p><\/div><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2><ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\"><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">13 de Dezembro de 2026<\/span><\/li><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px 