a<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Caminhada Lazer \/ Plogging 10 km<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\u23f0 Partida: 09:45<\/span><\/div><div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\"><div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">1\u00aa Fase:<\/strong> 13,00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (at\u00e9 31\/12\/2025)<\/span><\/div><div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">2\u00aa Fase:<\/strong> 16,00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (01\/01 a 07\/12\/2026 (22:00))<\/span><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/ul><\/div><!-- CARD 3: PERGUNTAS FREQUENTES (FAQS) --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u2753 Perguntas <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Frequentes (FAQ)<\/span><\/h2><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quando e a que horas se realiza o 3\u00ba Trail Winter Challenge S.A. \u2013 Vila Gal\u00e9 2026?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O evento realiza-se no domingo, 13 de dezembro de 2026, com partidas e chegadas no Hotel Vila Gal\u00e9 Ericeira \/ Praia da Baleia (concelho de Mafra). O secretariado funciona das 07:45 \u00e0s 09:00, o briefing realiza-se \u00e0s 09:15, o Trail Longo (20 km) parte \u00e0s 09:30, o Trail Curto (12 km) \u00e0s 09:40 e a Caminhada (10 km) \u00e0s 09:45.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o os pre\u00e7os de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o e descontos dispon\u00edveis?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">At\u00e9 7 de dezembro de 2026 (\u00e0s 22:00, ou limite de 500 inscritos pagos), os valores da 2\u00aa fase s\u00e3o: 24,00 \u20ac no Trail Longo (20 km), 20,00 \u20ac no Trail Curto (12 km) e 16,00 \u20ac na Caminhada (10 km) \u2014 ap\u00f3s a 1\u00aa fase de 20,00 \u20ac, 16,00 \u20ac\/17,00 \u20ac e 13,00 \u20ac. Equipas com 18 ou mais atletas beneficiam de 20% de desconto (n\u00e3o acumul\u00e1vel).<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">O que est\u00e1 inclu\u00eddo na inscri\u00e7\u00e3o e quais s\u00e3o os pr\u00e9mios Vila Gal\u00e9?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">Todos os participantes recebem 1 vale Vila Gal\u00e9 de 20,00 \u20ac, medalha finisher em formato puzzle do Circuito Challenge S.A., dorsal (com chip nos 20 km e 12 km), seguro desportivo, abastecimentos, habilita\u00e7\u00e3o ao sorteio de 1 estadia dupla Vila Gal\u00e9 e refor\u00e7o final com bolinhos, ch\u00e1 e caf\u00e9. No Trail Longo e Curto, o 1\u00ba classificado M\/F de cada escal\u00e3o (Seniores a Vet 65) ganha 1 estadia dupla Vila Gal\u00e9, o 2\u00ba ganha 1 vale de 40,00 \u20ac e o 3\u00ba ganha 1 inscri\u00e7\u00e3o gratuita no trail seguinte.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Qual \u00e9 o material obrigat\u00f3rio para participar?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">\u00c9 obrigat\u00f3rio levar recipiente\/copo pr\u00f3prio para abastecimento de l\u00edquidos, telem\u00f3vel operacional com bateria, documento de identifica\u00e7\u00e3o, cal\u00e7ado apropriado para trail e os pr\u00f3prios alfinetes para fixar o dorsal no peito.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Qual \u00e9 a idade m\u00ednima de participa\u00e7\u00e3o?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O Trail Longo (20 km) e o Trail Curto (12 km) destinam-se a atletas com idade igual ou superior a 18 anos. Na Caminhada (10 km) a idade m\u00ednima \u00e9 de 12 anos (menores de 18 anos participam sob inteira responsabilidade dos pais).<\/div><\/details><\/div><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"Trail Winter Challenge S.A. \u2013 Vila Gal\u00e9 2026\", \"startDate\": \"2026-12-13\", \"endDate\": \"2026-12-13\", \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\", \"eventStatus\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled\", \"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\", \"name\": \"Mafra, Lisboa\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"addressLocality\": \"Mafra\", \"addressRegion\": \"Lisboa\", \"addressCountry\": \"PT\"}}, \"description\": \"O 3\u00ba Trail Winter Challenge S.A. \u2013 Vila Gal\u00e9 2026 realiza-se a 13 de dezembro na Ericeira, Mafra. Trail 20 km, 12 km e Caminhada 10 km. Garante o teu dorsal!\", \"image\": [\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/cartaz-trail-winter-challenge-s-a-vila-gale.webp\"], \"offers\": [{\"@type\": \"Offer\", \"name\": \"Trail Longo 20 km\", \"price\": \"20.00\", \"priceCurrency\": \"EUR\", \"availability\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/InStock\", \"url\": \"https:\/\/www.trilhoperdido.com\/evento\/3-Trail-Winter-Challenge\"}, {\"@type\": \"Offer\", \"name\": \"Trail Curto 12 km\", \"price\": \"16.00\", \"priceCurrency\": \"EUR\", \"availability\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/InStock\", \"url\": \"https:\/\/www.trilhoperdido.com\/evento\/3-Trail-Winter-Challenge\"}, {\"@type\": \"Offer\", \"name\": \"Caminhada Lazer \/ Plogging 10 km\", \"price\": \"13.00\", \"priceCurrency\": \"EUR\", \"availability\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/InStock\", \"url\": \"https:\/\/www.trilhoperdido.com\/evento\/3-Trail-Winter-Challenge\"}]}<\/script><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quando e a que horas se realiza o 3\u00ba Trail Winter Challenge S.A. \u2013 Vila Gal\u00e9 2026?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O evento realiza-se no domingo, 13 de dezembro de 2026, com partidas e chegadas no Hotel Vila Gal\u00e9 Ericeira \/ Praia da Baleia (concelho de Mafra). O secretariado funciona das 07:45 \u00e0s 09:00, o briefing realiza-se \u00e0s 09:15, o Trail Longo (20 km) parte \u00e0s 09:30, o Trail Curto (12 km) \u00e0s 09:40 e a Caminhada (10 km) \u00e0s 09:45.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quais s\u00e3o os pre\u00e7os de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o e descontos dispon\u00edveis?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"At\u00e9 7 de dezembro de 2026 (\u00e0s 22:00, ou limite de 500 inscritos pagos), os valores da 2\u00aa fase s\u00e3o: 24,00 \u20ac no Trail Longo (20 km), 20,00 \u20ac no Trail Curto (12 km) e 16,00 \u20ac na Caminhada (10 km) \u2014 ap\u00f3s a 1\u00aa fase de 20,00 \u20ac, 16,00 \u20ac\/17,00 \u20ac e 13,00 \u20ac. Equipas com 18 ou mais atletas beneficiam de 20% de desconto (n\u00e3o acumul\u00e1vel).\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"O que est\u00e1 inclu\u00eddo na inscri\u00e7\u00e3o e quais s\u00e3o os pr\u00e9mios Vila Gal\u00e9?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Todos os participantes recebem 1 vale Vila Gal\u00e9 de 20,00 \u20ac, medalha finisher em formato puzzle do Circuito Challenge S.A., dorsal (com chip nos 20 km e 12 km), seguro desportivo, abastecimentos, habilita\u00e7\u00e3o ao sorteio de 1 estadia dupla Vila Gal\u00e9 e refor\u00e7o final com bolinhos, ch\u00e1 e caf\u00e9. No Trail Longo e Curto, o 1\u00ba classificado M\/F de cada escal\u00e3o (Seniores a Vet 65) ganha 1 estadia dupla Vila Gal\u00e9, o 2\u00ba ganha 1 vale de 40,00 \u20ac e o 3\u00ba ganha 1 inscri\u00e7\u00e3o gratuita no trail seguinte.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Qual \u00e9 o material obrigat\u00f3rio para participar?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"\u00c9 obrigat\u00f3rio levar recipiente\/copo pr\u00f3prio para abastecimento de l\u00edquidos, telem\u00f3vel operacional com bateria, documento de identifica\u00e7\u00e3o, cal\u00e7ado apropriado para trail e os pr\u00f3prios alfinetes para fixar o dorsal no peito.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Qual \u00e9 a idade m\u00ednima de participa\u00e7\u00e3o?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O Trail Longo (20 km) e o Trail Curto (12 km) destinam-se a atletas com idade igual ou superior a 18 anos. Na Caminhada (10 km) a idade m\u00ednima \u00e9 de 12 anos (menores de 18 anos participam sob inteira responsabilidade dos pais).\"}}]}<\/script>","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":70251,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"_acf_changed":false},"tags":[],"event_type":[672,22,497,498],"event_type_2":[33,727,820],"event_type_3":[],"event_type_4":[],"event_type_5":[],"class_list":["post-39436","ajde_events","type-ajde_events","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","event_location-mafra-lisboa","event_type-caminhada","event_type-trail","event_type-trail-curto","event_type-trail-longo","event_type_2-lisboa","event_type_2-lisboa-e-centro","event_type_2-portugal"],"acf":[],"featured_image_src":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/cartaz-trail-winter-challenge-s-a-vila-gale.webp","ams_acf":[],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events\/39436","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/ajde_events"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/1"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=39436"}],"version-history":[{"count":5,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events\/39436\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":70935,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events\/39436\/revisions\/70935"}],"wp:featuredmedia":[{"embeddable":true,"hr